/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 54 0 R
/E (The system will provide a simple interface for users to enter sequences and analyze their similarities. It can be useful in gene comparison, protein analysis, mutation identification, conserved-region detection, and biological research. The project will demonstrate how sequence alignment can be implemented as a practical bioinformatics application using Java.)
